{
  "mn49:0.1": "Majjhima Nikāya 49 ",
  "mn49:0.2": "Brahmanimantanikasutta ",
  "mn49:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "mn49:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā sāvatthiyaṁ viharati jetavane anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme. ",
  "mn49:1.3": "Tatra kho bhagavā bhikkhū āmantesi: ",
  "mn49:1.4": "“bhikkhavo”ti. ",
  "mn49:1.5": "“Bhadante”ti te bhikkhū bhagavato paccassosuṁ. ",
  "mn49:1.6": "Bhagavā etadavoca: ",
  "mn49:2.1": "“Ekamidāhaṁ, bhikkhave, samayaṁ ukkaṭṭhāyaṁ viharāmi subhagavane sālarājamūle. ",
  "mn49:2.2": "Tena kho pana, bhikkhave, samayena bakassa brahmuno evarūpaṁ pāpakaṁ diṭṭhigataṁ uppannaṁ hoti: ",
  "mn49:2.3": "‘idaṁ niccaṁ, idaṁ dhuvaṁ, idaṁ sassataṁ, idaṁ kevalaṁ, idaṁ acavanadhammaṁ, idañhi na jāyati na jīyati na mīyati na cavati na upapajjati, ito ca panaññaṁ uttari nissaraṇaṁ natthī’ti. ",
  "mn49:3.1": "Atha khvāhaṁ, bhikkhave, bakassa brahmuno cetasā cetoparivitakkamaññāya—",
  "mn49:3.2": "seyyathāpi nāma balavā puriso samiñjitaṁ vā bāhaṁ pasāreyya, pasāritaṁ vā bāhaṁ samiñjeyya; evameva—ukkaṭṭhāyaṁ subhagavane sālarājamūle antarahito tasmiṁ brahmaloke pāturahosiṁ. ",
  "mn49:3.3": "Addasā kho maṁ, bhikkhave, bako brahmā dūratova āgacchantaṁ; ",
  "mn49:3.4": "disvāna maṁ etadavoca: ",
  "mn49:3.5": "‘ehi kho, mārisa, svāgataṁ, mārisa. ",
  "mn49:3.6": "Cirassaṁ kho, mārisa, imaṁ pariyāyamakāsi yadidaṁ idhāgamanāya. ",
  "mn4